  "description": "The Reaction C:62 Race condenses everything our engineering team has learnt about high performance carbon frame construction into a light, strong and impressively responsive chassis. The short rear end with Boost thru axle and Agile Ride Geometry creates a lively, responsive ride feel while an integrated headset and PressFit bottom bracket save precious grammes without sacrificing performance. Slim seatstays and a 27.2mm seatpost help ensure you'll stay comfortable for longer, even when you're giving it your all. And internal cable routing keeps gear shifts clean and precise in even the worst riding conditions, reducing the need for maintenance and ensuring you never miss a shift. We even remembered to include cable routing for a dropper post, should you wish to upgrade in the future. We tried to think of everything, so you can just concentrate on the riding.",
